OverTheWire Bandit: Level 15 → 16

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 16.
The password is available from a service running on localhost port 30001, which requires an SSL/TLS connection.

Steps
Log in as bandit15:
ssh bandit15@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Connect securely to the service using openssl:
openssl s_client -connect localhost:30001
Paste the password for Bandit 15 and press Enter.

Result
The service responds with the password for Bandit Level 16.
